    "Generated read-only from the workbook; each months array is January..December. null = no source entry; 0 = a typed zero in the source. Values were traced to their source cells, not retyped.",
    "A month is null when the workbook shows 0 only because a formula sums or references blank cells: Near Miss Feb, Mar, Oct-Dec (Incident Data!B6:M6 = Dash!C22:N22, sums of blank area cells); Incident Oct-Dec (Dash!L41:N41); LOPC May (Incident Data!F59 = F17, blank); PIT Aug (Incident Data!I129 = I20, blank).",
    "Incident and Near Miss are the explicit monthly rows Incident Data!A6:M7. Incident is not derived from Incident Classification and no classification was adjusted.",
    "SOURCE CORRECTION (approved 2026-10-06): Incident May = 3, not the workbook's displayed 2. Dash!G41 (May) is =SUM(G27:G38) and omits the Mundy and 3rd Party rows; the May area cells Dash!G27:G40 sum to 3 (G36 WHSE 2 + G40 3rd Party 1). Every other month sums rows 27-40. With May = 3 the monthly Incident values sum to 41 = Incident Data!N7 (Dash!O41). The workbook was not modified.",
    "Superseded workbook figures after the May correction: Incident Data!F7 and AM72 show May = 2, and 'Total EHS Incidents' 2026 (Incident Data!AU72) shows 40. Approved Incident 2026 YTD = 41.",
    "Property / Equipment Damage: the workbook keeps Property Damage (Incident Data row 21) and Equipment Damage (row 22) as separate rows, mapped to the separate classification categories. The combined 'PROPERTY/ EQUIP. DAMAGE YTD' block (row 123) has only January = 1 entered; it is mapped as is (approved: January = 1, February-December unreported) and not reconstructed from rows 21 and 22.",
    "Not mapped: Incident Data row 14 'Recordable ' (entirely blank; no seeded category; may duplicate 'Recordable Injury'). Process Safety Incidents (Incident Data!AH92:AU94, 2026 Feb-Apr = 1 each; no seeded category). Rows with a stated total of 0 that is a sum of blank cells (Lost Time Injury, Restricted, Occupational Illness, Regulatory) have no expectedYtd entry.",
    "Other sources disagree and were not used: Rates!E29:J37 (typed 2026 counts) gives LTI Aug = 1 (Incident Data has none), First Aid YTD 4 (vs 5; Sep), Equipment Failure YTD 1 (vs 8), Property Damage YTD 11 (vs 6), LOC May = 0 (Incident Data blank). Area Data!C7:P23 gives Property/Equipment Damage 12, Equipment Failure 0, Non-Work Related 5 (vs 4)."
